description	"Mara Jade Skywalker

^9Weapons:
- Melee
^2-- RoF: 1.11x
- Lightsaber ^9(Yellow/Blue)
-- Saber Defense (2)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Blaster Deflect (2)
-- Damage: 240/^2130
^2-- Spec Damage: 1.25x
- Hold-out Blaster Pistol (3)
^2-- Charged Drain: 1.1x
^1-- Velocity: .8x
- Thermal Grenade (4)
^2-- Damage: 2x
- Sonic Detonator (1)

^3Abilities:
- Saber Throw (1) ^3[Saber CS1]
^2-- Damage: 40
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact Jump]

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (2)
- Push (2)
- Pull (1)
- Sense (1)
- Mind Trick (3) ^3[CS4]
- Speed (2) ^3[CS3]

^6Items:
- Medpac ^3[CS2]

^8Attributes:
- Force Block (2)
- Force Focus (1)
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Uncivilized

A duelist and pistoleer hybrid that rewards skillful flanking and swapping of weapons and Force Powers."